# DRAW keymap preset: GIMP (2.10 / 3.0 default keyboard shortcuts)
#
# Format: actionId keycode requireMods forbidMods [device button]
#   mods bits: 1=Ctrl 2=Shift 4=Alt. forbidMods 0 = every modifier the row does not require
#   (Shift stays allowed on printable non-letters like > { + _ , typed with it).
#   A row that must leave Shift+key alone (Ctrl+] vs Ctrl+Shift+]) writes forbidMods 6.
#   Ctrl+Shift+punctuation is the UNshifted key with Ctrl+Shift: Ctrl+Shift+' = 39 3 (not 34).
#   Keycodes: letters are lowercase ASCII (Shift+letter = the letter, requireMods 2);
#   Tab 9, Backspace 8, Enter 13, Insert 20992, Delete 21248, F1 15104 ... F10 17408,
#   F11 34048, F12 34304. Action ids: GUI/COMMAND.BM (CMD_init) / SHORTCUTS.md.
# How a keymap applies (CFG/BINDINGS.BM BINDINGS_apply):
#   - an action's Nth row moves its Nth key; a row past the keys it has ADDS one
#   - a DRAW key a row takes is unbound (that DRAW action loses the key)
#   - keys no row takes keep their DRAW meaning
# Mac apps: Cmd is Ctrl here, Option is Alt.
# Already the same in DRAW (no row): T text, Z zoom, X swap colours, [ ] brush size,
#   Ctrl+Z / Ctrl+Y undo / redo, Ctrl+A select all, Ctrl+Shift+N new layer,
#   Ctrl+Shift+D duplicate layer, Ctrl+L layers dialog, Ctrl+Shift+C copy visible,
#   Ctrl+F repeat last filter, Delete clear, Ctrl+N / O / S / Shift+S / Q.
# Not in DRAW (no row): Shift+O select by colour, I scissors, Shift+M measure, Q align,
#   Shift+T unified transform, Shift+L handle transform, W warp, G gradient, K ink,
#   Y MyPaint brush, C clone, H heal, S smudge, Shift+D dodge / burn, Shift+G cage,
#   Ctrl+H anchor layer, 2-5 zoom presets (DRAW: Z+digit), Ctrl+D duplicate image.
# GIMP has no rectangle / ellipse / polygon / line drawing tools: DRAW's R, E, P, L keys go
#   to GIMP's jobs (R / E select, P paintbrush); C ellipse and L line keep their keys.
# DRAW keys this preset takes: Tab toolbar, Ctrl+B custom brush capture (GIMP: toolbox),
#   Ctrl+, Settings (GIMP: fill with FG - open Settings from the menu), 1 opacity 10%,
#   Ctrl+E clear selection (Delete still clears), Ctrl+T custom-font text, Ctrl+M
#   character map, Ctrl+Shift+E export again (moves to Ctrl+E).

# --- Tools ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
112 114 0 0     # R        rectangle select       -> Marquee
121 101 0 0     # E        ellipse select         -> Ellipse Select
119 102 0 0     # F        free select (lasso)    -> Freehand Select
117 117 0 0     # U        fuzzy select           -> Magic Wand
122 98 0 0      # B        paths                  -> Bezier
104 111 0 0     # O        colour picker
113 118 0 0     # V        (DRAW's move key, kept)
113 109 0 0     # M        move
1802 99 2 0     # Shift+C  crop                   -> Crop Canvas
328 114 2 0     # Shift+R  rotate                 -> Transform: Rotate
325 115 2 0     # Shift+S  scale                  -> Transform: Scale
329 104 2 0     # Shift+H  shear                  -> Transform: Shear
327 112 2 0     # Shift+P  perspective            -> Transform: Perspective
315 102 2 0     # Shift+F  flip                   -> Flip Horizontal
103 98 2 0      # Shift+B  bucket fill            -> Fill
101 112 0 0     # P        paintbrush             -> Brush
101 110 0 0     # N        pencil                 -> Brush (DRAW's brush is hard-edged)
1702 97 0 0     # A        airbrush               -> Spray
118 101 2 0     # Shift+E  eraser
518 100 0 0     # D        default colours

# --- View ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
403 9 0 0       # Tab      hide docks             -> Toggle All UI
401 98 1 0      # Ctrl+B   toolbox                -> Toggle Toolbar
405 48 1 0      # Ctrl+0   (DRAW's own key, kept)
405 49 0 0      # 1        zoom 1:1               -> Reset Zoom
406 61 1 0      # Ctrl+=   (DRAW's own key, kept)
406 43 0 0      # +        zoom in
406 61 0 0      # =        zoom in (+ without Shift)
407 45 1 0      # Ctrl+-   (DRAW's own key, kept)
407 45 0 0      # -        zoom out
453 34048 0 0   # F11      fullscreen             -> Toggle Fullscreen

# --- Edit / select / layers / file -------------------------------------------------------
313 44 1 0      # Ctrl+,        fill with FG colour
314 46 1 0      # Ctrl+.        fill with BG colour
307 97 3 0      # Ctrl+Shift+A  select none        -> Deselect
311 105 1 0     # Ctrl+I        invert selection
332 116 1 0     # Ctrl+T        toggle selection display -> Hide Selection
706 109 1 0     # Ctrl+M        merge visible layers
2217 101 1 0    # Ctrl+E        export to (the same file again) -> Export Again
2204 101 3 0    # Ctrl+Shift+E  export as          -> Export as PNG
